# 📊 AI Data Analyst Agent

An AI-powered data analysis application that allows users to upload CSV or Excel files and ask questions about their data using natural language.

The application uses **Groq LLM** to generate Python/Pandas analysis code, executes the code on the actual uploaded dataset, and displays accurate computed results with supporting tables, visualizations, and AI-generated explanations.

---

## 🚀 Project Overview

The **AI Data Analyst Agent** allows users to interact with structured datasets without manually writing Python or Pandas code.

Users can upload a CSV or Excel file and ask questions such as:

> Which region has the highest sales?

or:

> Which region grew fastest last quarter?

The system generates the required Pandas code, executes it on the real dataset, and presents the result.

---

## ✨ Features

- 📁 Upload CSV files
- 📊 Upload Excel `.xlsx` files
- 📋 Preview uploaded datasets
- 🔍 View dataset information
- 📊 Display rows and columns
- ❗ Detect missing values
- 🔄 Detect duplicate rows
- 🔎 View column information
- 💬 Ask questions using natural language
- 🤖 Generate Pandas code using Groq
- 🧮 Perform real calculations using Pandas
- 📊 Display computed results
- 📈 Generate visualizations using Plotly
- 🐍 View generated Python code
- 💡 Generate AI explanations
- ⬇️ Download computed results
- 📅 Support date and quarterly analysis

---

# 🧠 How It Works

The application follows this workflow:

```text
              Upload CSV / Excel
                      │
                      ▼
              Pandas DataFrame
                      │
                      ▼
             User Question
                      │
                      ▼
                 Groq LLM
                      │
                      ▼
          Pandas Analysis Code
                      │
                      ▼
          Execute on Real Dataset
                      │
                      ▼
             Computed Result
                │          │
                ▼          ▼
           AI Answer    Visualization
                │          │
                └────┬─────┘
                     ▼
               Streamlit UI
